  "solution": "Hàm số bậc hai có công thức tổng quát  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Đồ thị cắt trục tung tại điểm có tung độ bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Hoành độ đỉnh là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó công thức của hàm số là  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Đồ thị hàm số lại qua đỉnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên ta có  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy hàm số cần tìm là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
